  "score_support": "supports_wrong_score",
  "score_support_basis": "理由把“提到MVCIL setup”当作完全可定位证据，并据此推出5分；该证据链正是服务于错误的CoT分数，而非真实标签3所要求的“定位不确定但问题具体”。",
  "error_sentences": [
    {
      "sentence": "The comment explicitly mentions \"the MVCIL setup,\" which is a specific part of the paper, making it fully grounded.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "只点名一个方法/设定名称并不等于明确指出章节、表、图或可唯一锚定的部分；按 rubric，这达不到4/5所需的“explicitly mentions which part/obvious to authors”，却被直接当成fully grounded。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "The authors can easily identify the section or description of the setup being referenced.",
      "error_type": "unsupported_inference",
      "explanation": "评论没有给出section/table/figure或唯一位置，仅泛指MVCIL setup，无法推出作者能轻易精确定位；这与“弱grounded、需猜测”的情形更相符。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "Therefore, the comment is both fully grounded and specific, aligning with score 5.",
      "error_type": "score_mapping_error",
      "explanation": "5分要求既明确锚定具体部分又说明问题；该评论对问题陈述较具体，但定位仅停留在笼统setup层面，映射到5分抬高了grounding门槛对应的档位。"
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "CoT将笼统提及“MVCIL setup”误判为可精确定位，从而把弱grounded拔高为完全grounded并给出5；其证据主要支持错误分数，真实标签3更合理。"
}
